flowchart TD
    N["Operational need<br/>outbound relay dwell"] --> B["System boundary<br/>carrier and black-box payload"]
    B --> A["Allocate four flows<br/>traffic | command | power | support"]
    A --> I["Declare geometry, radio, payload,<br/>and carrier assumptions"]
