    I --> C["Carrier check<br/>power, energy, and mass closure"]
    L --> V["Independent numerical checks<br/>and saved-case review"]
    C --> V
    V --> D["Design implication<br/>link | size | no closure | pass"]
    D -.-> F["Outstanding physical verification<br/>and operational validation"]
